  "description": "Compact 36px disclosure headers use a quiet hover surface, subtle dividers, optional icons and counts, and a 12px nested-content inset. Use single mode for one open section or multiple mode for independent groups. Arrow keys, Home, and End move between enabled headers; Enter and Space toggle them. Keep form values outside collapsing content when they must persist.",
